2.4 Non-Functional Requirements
ID	Category	Requirement
NFR1	Performance	Outline generation must feel interactive; total latency dominated by five sequential diffusion calls
NFR2	Modularity	Each pipeline stage in its own module; a model swap must not require editing other stages
NFR3	Fault isolation	One panel's failure must not abort the comic
NFR4	Portability	Runs locally under Uvicorn with no cloud dependency
NFR5	Security	API keys read from environment variables only; .env never committed
NFR6	Reliability	Per-panel retry with backoff on rate limits
NFR7	Usability	A non-technical user completes a comic without instruction
2.5 External Interface Requirements
Form inputs — story_prompt, character_name, setting (school / forest / space / city), tone (light-hearted / dramatic / poetic / funny), art_style (anime / pixel art / comic book / realistic), POSTed to /generate.

